2026-04-02 Update - UX and Form Flow Improvements:
- Updated `PersonController` to accept both browser form posts and JSON posts while preserving the existing redirect-based page flow.
- Updated `PageController` so `create-person?success=true` and `create-organization?success=true` render success state in the template model.
- Added page instructions to `index.html`, `organization.html`, `person.html`, and `orgchart.html` to clarify the intended workflow and expected inputs.
- Added a `Back to Home` button on `orgchart.html`.
- Updated the org chart page JavaScript so clicking `See Org Chart` now distinguishes between:
- organization does not exist
- organization exists but no people have been added yet
