2026-04-02 Update - Org Chart Data Bug Fix:
- Investigated a mismatch where adding `dan@fishdan.com` reported "already exists" while the org chart for `fishdan.com` appeared empty.
- Confirmed live data existed for `fishdan.com`, but `person.supervisor_email` was stored as an empty string instead of `NULL`.
- Identified that `OrgChartController` treated only `NULL` supervisor values as top-level people, so records with blank supervisor email were excluded from the rendered tree root.
- Updated `PersonService` to normalize blank `supervisorEmail` input to `null` before saving.
- Updated `OrgChartController` to treat both `null` and blank supervisor email values as top-level nodes.
- Ran a one-time MariaDB cleanup:
- `update person set supervisor_email = null where supervisor_email is not null and trim(supervisor_email) = '';`
- Verified `GET /api/orgchart?domain=fishdan.com` now returns people instead of `[]`.

